hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"253","(44) Sahw ka bab - Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Majishun Abdul Aziz ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Salamah ne mujhe bataya, unhon ne kaha: Zayd ibn Aslam ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn Yasar se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein teen aur chaar ke bare mein shak kare to use chahiye ke khara ho aur ek rak'at padhe, hatta ke shak zyadati mein ho jaye, phir salam pherne se pehle sahw ke do sajde kare, phir agar us ne paanch padhi to wo us ke liye sifarish karenge, aur agar chaar padhi to wo shaitan ko ruswa karenge."
"254","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi aur Ahmad ibn Sa'id al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne mujhe bataya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman al-A'raj ne mujhe bataya ke unhon ne Ibn Buhaynah ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhein namaz padhai to do rak'aton mein khare ho gaye, to hum ne un ke liye tasbeeh ki to wo apni namaz mein aage badhte rahe, phir do sajde kiye, phir salam phera. Yeh hadees al-Darimi ki hai."
"255","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ibn Abi Imran al-Hilali ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Ibn Sirin se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein dopahar ki do namazon mein se ek namaz padhai, ya Zuhar ya Asr, mera khayal hai ke wo Asr thi, to Aap ne do rak'atein padhein phir salam phera, phir aage badhe aur khajoor ke tane ke paas naraaz ki tarah baith gaye, to jaldi karne wale log chale gaye aur wo keh rahe the: Namaz kam ho gayi, namaz kam ho gayi! To Zu al-Yadain aage badhe aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya namaz kam ho gayi? Ya Aap bhool gaye? To Aap ne farmaya: Kya Zu al-Yadain sach keh raha hai? Logon ne kaha: Ji haan, unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne do rak'atein padhein phir salam phera, aur takbeer kahi aur sajda kiya, phir takbeer kahi aur sar uthaya, phir takbeer kahi aur sajda kiya, phir takbeer kahi aur sar uthaya."
"256","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ibn Qudamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Ibrahim se, Alqamah se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein namaz padhai to namaz mein zyadati ki ya kami ki, Mansur ne kaha: Ibrahim ne kaha: Ise bhoolne wale Alqamah hain, ya Alqamah ne Abdullah se (riwayat kiya), phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) namaz se farigh hue to apne chehre ke sath hamari taraf mutawajjeh hue, to hum ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya namaz mein koi nayi baat ho gayi hai? Aap ne farmaya: Wo kya hai? To hum ne Aap ko us kaam ki khabar di jo Aap ne kiya tha, to Aap ne apni tang modi aur qibla ki taraf rukh kiya aur do sajde kiye, phir hamari taraf wapas aaye aur farmaya: Agar namaz mein koi nayi baat hoti to main tumhein zaroor batata, lekin main bashar hun, yaad karta hun jaise tum yaad karte ho, aur bhoolta hun jaise tum bhoolte ho, pas jab main bhool jaun to mujhe yaad dilao, aur tum mein se jo apni namaz mein shak kare to use chahiye ke durust baat se zyada qareeb ko dekhe aur us par poora kare, phir salam phere aur do sajde kare."
"257","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Mu'tamir ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hazza se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Muhallab se, Imran ibn Husayn Raziallahu anhu se: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Asr ki namaz teen rak'at padh kar salam pher diya, to Aap se kaha gaya, to Aap ne ek rak'at padhi, phir salam phera, phir do sajde kiye, phir salam phera."
"258","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Idris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hasan ibn Ubaydullah se suna, Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Alqamah ne unhein paanch rak'atein padhayin, unhon ne kaha: To logon ne kaha: Ae Abu Shibl, Aap ne namaz mein zyadati ki, unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne kaha: Main ne aisa nahin kiya, unhon ne kaha: Logon ne kaha: Kyun nahin, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim ne kaha: To main ne masjid ke kinare se kaha: Kyun nahin, unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne kaha: Aur tum ae kana, kya tum bhi yehi kehte ho? Un hon ne kaha: To wo phire aur un ke sath do sajde kiye, phir un se Abdullah se hadees bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhein paanch rak'atein padhayin, unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne un ke sath baithe hue do sajde kiye aur farmaya: Main sirf ek bashar hun, bhoolta hun jaise tum bhoolte ho. Yeh Ibrahim, Ibn Suwayd al-Nakhai hain, aur Ibrahim ibn Yazid al-Nakhai nahin hain."
"259","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn al-Muthanna al-Ansari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ash'ath ne mujhe bataya, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Khalid al-Hazza se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Muhallab se, Imran ibn Husayn Raziallahu anhu se: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhein namaz padhai to apni namaz mein bhool gaye, to sahw ke do sajde kiye, phir tashahhud padha, phir salam phera."
